_at":"2025-07-25T01:57:22Z","closed_at":"2025-07-25T01:57:13Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108167","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108167","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108167.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108167.patch","merged_at":"2025-07-25T01:57:13Z"},"body":"We try to get the value out of a dictionary in order to establish its type for completion purposes. However, if the dictionary or the key is not a constant, we cannot safely get the actual value, so we skip this and just try to infer from static typing.\r\n\r\n> [!NOTE]\r\n> ~~This also adds a change in core: it removes type validation from `Dictionary.has()` (and `has_all()`) because it simplifies checking if a given key is valid without having to check its type externally.~~\r\n> This now exposes the `ContainerTypeValidate` object from the dictionary and add a function to it to test a value without generating errors. This way the completion code can check it before trying to get the key.\r\n\r\nFix #102926\r\nSupersedes #104757\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/code_style_guidelines.html\r\n-->\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}"